Uses Bosses of Mass Destruction, by barribob (miyo6032), and its Forge/NeoForge
port by CerbonXD. Both projects publish GNU LGPL version 3 license texts.
https://github.com/barribob/bosses-of-mass-destruction
https://github.com/CERBON-MODS/Bosses-of-Mass-Destruction-FORGE

Native projectile callbacks are adapted for Ars invocation in
dev.bomdnouveau.casting.NativePayloads. GroundEffects additionally adapts
Obsidilith BurstAction, WaveAction and SpikeAction timing and placement,
and invokes native RiftBurst / WallTeleport. Changes: caller/target geometry,
fixed hard-mode damage, Ars amplification, payment and world lifecycle.
The native mod is a separately installed dependency, not bundled here.
Its textures/models/sounds are referenced at runtime, not redistributed.
